  "aboutHeroTitleHighlight": "Excellence",
  "aboutHeroText": "For over two decades, EduLearning Platform has redefined educational standards. We don't just teach syllabus; we engineer thought processes, cultivating the analytical minds required to conquer the most challenging competitive landscapes.",
