  "aboutMissionTitle": "Our Mission",
  "aboutMissionText": "To provide unparalleled academic coaching through a rigorous, technology-integrated curriculum. We strive to unlock the latent potential within every student, transforming raw ambition into measurable success through systematic guidance and unwavering mentorship.",
  "aboutVisionTitle": "Our Vision",
  "aboutVisionText": "To be the undisputed national leader in competitive exam preparation. We envision a future where 'EduLearning Platform' is synonymous with academic supremacy, creating a legacy of leaders, innovators, and professionals who shape tomorrow's world.",
  "aboutMethodologyTitle": "Structured Teaching Methodology",
  "aboutMethodologySubtitle": "Success isn't accidental. It is the result of our scientifically designed, iterative learning framework that ensures conceptual mastery and exam readiness.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep1Title": "Learn",
  "aboutMethodologyStep1Text": "Comprehensive delivery of core concepts by expert faculty, utilizing interactive modern pedagogical tools to ensure deep understanding.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep2Title": "Practice",
  "aboutMethodologyStep2Text": "Rigorous application of learned concepts through structured assignments, curated problem sets, and daily practice papers.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep3Title": "Test",
  "aboutMethodologyStep3Text": "Simulated examination environments with periodic part-syllabus and full-syllabus tests aligned perfectly with exam patterns.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep4Title": "Analyze",
  "aboutMethodologyStep4Text": "Micro-level performance analysis using our proprietary tech platform to identify weak areas, speed issues, and conceptual gaps.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep5Title": "Improve",
  "aboutMethodologyStep5Text": "Targeted doubt-clearing sessions and personalized remedial action plans designed to systematically eliminate weaknesses.",
  "aboutMethodologyStep6Title": "Succeed",
  "aboutMethodologyStep6Text": "The final outcome. Entering the examination hall with supreme confidence, leading to top-tier ranks and admissions into dream institutes.",
